WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.370
Hi Jessica!

2
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.810
Welcome. Please, come in.

3
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:17.030
Thank you!

4
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:20.150
Your house looks nice.

5
00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.810
Who do you live with?

6
00:00:22.810 --> 00:00:28.060
I live with my mom, my dad, and my brother, Tom.

7
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.070
Nice! Is Tom at home?

8
00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:34.080
Yes, he is in his room.

9
00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:36.890
This is the living room.

10
00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:40.470
My family spends a lot of time here.

11
00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:42.070
It’s so cozy.

12
00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:44.050
I like the sofa.

13
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.660
Thank you.

14
00:00:45.660 --> 00:00:50.270
We watch TV on this sofa every evening.

15
00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:54.620
And this is my father’s favorite armchair.

16
00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:56.990
That is the bookshelf.

17
00:00:56.980 --> 00:01:00.310
We keep books and photos there.

18
00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.260
Here is the kitchen.

19
00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:06.270
My mother cooks dinner here.

20
00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.820
Is that a new fridge?

21
00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.260
Yes, it is.

22
00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:16.770
We also have a microwave and a small dining table.

23
00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:18.810
Do you eat breakfast here?

24
00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:21.050
Yes, we do.

25
00:01:26.870 --> 00:01:29.110
This is my bedroom.

26
00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:31.480
It is my favorite room.

27
00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:34.750
Wow!It’s pretty!

28
00:01:34.810 --> 00:01:37.180
Your bed looks very soft.

29
00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:40.640
And you have a nice desk for your homework.

30
00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:44.790
Yes. I also have a wardrobe for my clothes.

31
00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:48.050
I like your posters on it.

32
00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:52.220
That is my brother Tom’s room.

33
00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:54.200
Can we see it?

34
00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:55.420
Just quickly.

35
00:01:55.420 --> 00:01:57.600
It is very messy!

36
00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:01.690
Hi, Tom! Nice to meet you!

37
00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:04.830
Your room has a lot of games.

38
00:02:04.830 --> 00:02:07.480
Yes, I love video games.

39
00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:12.340
Finally, this is the backyard.

40
00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:15.480
Wow! It is beautiful.

41
00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.960
In the summer, we sit in the garden.

42
00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:23.350
My dog likes to play here too.

43
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:27.120
You have a lovely home, Emma.

44
00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:28.980
Thank you for showing me.

45
00:02:28.980 --> 00:02:31.410
You are welcome, Jessica!

46
00:02:31.410 --> 00:02:34.670
Let’s go back to the kitchen and have some juice.

47
00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:39.800
Now, let's learn some useful vocabulary.

48
00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:42.370
Living room

49
00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.240
Sofa

50
00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.420
Kitchen

51
00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:49.850
Fridge

52
00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.400
Bedroom

53
00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.970
Wardrobe

54
00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.590
Garden
